EvaluateVideoQuality.responseParamsDescription:
## Query Result  
This API is asynchronous and does not return the actual request result immediately. You must use the returned RequestId to invoke the GetAsyncJobResult API to retrieve the actual result of this request. For more information, see [GetAsyncJobResult](~~607824~~).

## SDK Reference  
We recommend using a software development kit (SDK) to call the video quality assessment capability under the Video Recognition category of Alibaba Cloud Vision AI. The SDK supports multiple programming languages. When invoking the SDK, select the SDK package for the AI category "Video Recognition" (videorecog). The file parameter supports both local files and arbitrary URLs when called through the SDK. For details, see [SDK Overview](~~145033~~).

## Sample Code  
For sample code in commonly used programming languages for this capability, see [Video Quality Assessment Sample Code](~~608851~~). For sample code to query asynchronous task results in commonly used languages, see [Query Asynchronous Task Result Sample Code](~~607974~~).

## Interpretation of Video Quality Assessment Scores  
The algorithm returns two fields: **JsonUrl** and **PdfUrl**. **PdfUrl** provides a comprehensive PDF report summarizing the overall video quality assessment. **JsonUrl** provides a detailed JSON-formatted quality assessment report, including sequences of sampled frames and per-shot or per-frame scores for each quality metric, facilitating in-depth analysis and processing of video quality issues.

